  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"c0243ad3-0326-4b6b-82f1-5ef6ffa890f1"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["MergeDiagram",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/DiagrammaticComputation/ref/MergeDiagram"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"82810e99-1669-473d-8c07-a2816ac52e9f"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["CapDiagram",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/DiagrammaticComputation/ref/CapDiagram"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"7dd07e07-6e1c-4e0a-9138-14b3201c465f"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["CupDiagram",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/DiagrammaticComputation/ref/CupDiagram"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"61c62e8d-197f-4558-9ff0-2e3b05e37493"],
 " \[LongDash] all of these are special cases."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ec7b625b-35cc-43b3-99fb-689bcaa4fde3"],

Cell["\<\
It is the basic structural junction in ZX-style and other process-theoretic \
calculi.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"93f11f75-d27e-4fcb-9c82-b79958a6fd04"],

Cell["\<\
Spiders fuse: two spiders meeting at a shared wire merge into a single spider \
whose legs are the union (this is the spider law).\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"da7c41bb-1a91-4005-8f36-d0eab7fb7bcd"]
}, Open  ]],

